WEBVTT

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.340
og lære af hinanden.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:04.981
Så jeg synger en blues

00:13:04.991 --> 00:13:09.150
som - (Bifald) -

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:13.664
kaldes "Scooped igen"

00:13:13.664 --> 00:13:17.177
og jeg beder publikum om at være backing kor

00:13:17.177 --> 00:13:20.215
og siger "teksten er scoop scoop".

00:13:20.215 --> 00:13:22.495
Det lyder sådan: "Scoop scoop".

00:13:22.495 --> 00:13:24.030
Den lyder sådan.

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.603
"Jeg er blevet scooped igen"

00:13:25.603 --> 00:13:27.592
"Scoop scoop"

00:13:27.592 --> 00:13:28.975
Vi prøver det!

00:13:28.975 --> 00:13:30.913
"Jeg er blevet scooped igen"